{"id":"4f176786881b1435","group":"93","path":"93/93-lem-congruence-kernel.md","title":"Congruence Kernel","display":"Congruence Kernel","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-lem-congruence-kernel","aliases":["93-lem-congruence-kernel"],"display":"Congruence Kernel","authors":"W. J. Blok, Don Pigozzi","book_title":"Algebraizable Logics","depends_on":["[[93-df-homomorphism]]","[[93-df-congruence]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-lem-congruence-kernel"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-lem-congruence-kernel</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Congruence Kernel"},{"key":"authors","html":"W. J. Blok, Don Pigozzi"},{"key":"book_title","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f10e7e3251fa7f7d\" href=\"?note=f10e7e3251fa7f7d\" title=\"93-df-homomorphism\">93-df-homomorphism</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"30b341bfbd8b5301\" href=\"?note=30b341bfbd8b5301\" title=\"93-df-congruence\">93-df-congruence</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"lem-congruence-kernel---Congruence-Kernel\">lem-congruence-kernel - Congruence Kernel</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Hom}_{93}(h,\\mathbf A,\\mathbf B)\">\\(\\mathrm{Hom}_{93}(h,\\mathbf A,\\mathbf B)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ker}_{93}(h;\\mathbf A)\">\\(\\mathrm{Ker}_{93}(h;\\mathbf A)\\)</span> is defined here.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A)\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A)\\)</span> is the congruence lattice of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf A\">\\(\\mathbf A\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}congruence\\text{-}kernel}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Ker}_{93}(h;\\mathbf A)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle a,a&#39;\\rangle\\in|\\mathbf A|^2:h(a)=h(a&#39;)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}congruence\\text{-}kernel}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Ker}_{93}(h;\\mathbf A)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle a,a&#39;\\rangle\\in|\\mathbf A|^2:h(a)=h(a&#39;)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Hom}_{93}(h,\\mathbf A,\\mathbf B)\\to\n\\mathrm{Ker}_{93}(h;\\mathbf A)\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Hom}_{93}(h,\\mathbf A,\\mathbf B)\\to\n\\mathrm{Ker}_{93}(h;\\mathbf A)\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>Kernel congruences connect homomorphisms with quotient algebras.</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"lem-congruence-kernel---Congruence-Kernel","text":"lem-congruence-kernel - Congruence Kernel","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-homomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"f10e7e3251fa7f7d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-homomorphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-congruence","status":"resolved","id":"30b341bfbd8b5301","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-congruence]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Hom}_{93}(h,\\mathbf A,\\mathbf B)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ker}_{93}(h;\\mathbf A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}congruence\\text{-}kernel}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Ker}_{93}(h;\\mathbf A)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle a,a'\\rangle\\in|\\mathbf A|^2:h(a)=h(a')\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Hom}_{93}(h,\\mathbf A,\\mathbf B)\\to\n\\mathrm{Ker}_{93}(h;\\mathbf A)\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A).","display":true}],"bytes":888,"backlinks":[{"id":"e1621c792830f597","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ker}_{93}(h;\\mathbf A)$ is the kernel congruence of [[93-lem-congruence-kernel]], and $\\mathrm{ImAlg}_{93}(h;\\mathbf B,\\tau)$ is the induced algebra of [[93-df-homomorphic-image]]."},{"id":"ebabc4cd0b0d94d0","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$h[|\\mathbf A|]=|\\mathbf B|$, and $\\mathrm{Ker}_{93}(h;\\mathbf A)$ is the kernel congruence of [[93-lem-congruence-kernel]]."},{"id":"34a91ec31209cb96","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["f10e7e3251fa7f7d","30b341bfbd8b5301"]}